{"id":"rsxa3uxyazk72e7otcujv9c5s","title":"UCL团队首次用原子力显微镜成像细菌极结构","originalTitle":"Poles of bacteria imaged in fine detail for the first time","summary":"UCL团队在《Nature Communications》发表研究，首次通过原子力显微镜（AFM）实现静止细菌极的高分辨率成像。研究发现，快速分裂的细菌极部存在折叠状缺陷，且大肠杆菌、铜绿假单胞菌和鲍曼不动杆菌的表面微孔结构差异显著，可能影响抗生素敏感性。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-poles-bacteria-imaged-fine.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T21:10:01.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-10T21:18:06.887Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-10T21:18:06.887Z","category":"life-science","tags":["论文发表","研究成果"],"score":73,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"d8ea1bbd-510f-4cd9-b701-00c126fbad39","title":"UCL团队首次实现活体细菌极部高分辨率成像"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"d8ea1bbd-510f-4cd9-b701-00c126fbad39","title":"UCL团队首次实现活体细菌极部高分辨率成像"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f8TqVaHu3aKI","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}